    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abnormal event occurred in the model town of Silver Lake, a mistake in a secret government nuclear test at a small power plant unleashed a wave of chaos, which continues to spread...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silverlake pixel-art top-view game with roguelike elements. Combining exploration, permadeath, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps randomly generated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid combat system, with a mix of real-time turns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills to enhance specific elements of the survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with your character's needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and items to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. Upcoming updates planned:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer update.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Open World Update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abnormal event occurred in the model town of Silver Lake, a mistake in a secret government nuclear test at a small power plant unleashed a wave of chaos, which continues to spread...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silverlake pixel-art top-view game with roguelike elements. Combining exploration, permadeath, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps randomly generated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid combat system, with a mix of real-time turns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills to enhance specific elements of the survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with your character's needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and items to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. Upcoming updates planned:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer update.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Open World Update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
